{"id": "UgwPsWxA3xqYX_yxTut4AaABAg.AWv1flxQtXxAWv5El44k7U", "parent": "UgwPsWxA3xqYX_yxTut4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "@iiiiilllllili물적분할을 누가 예상함?? 말도 안되는 소릴하네 ㅋㅋ", "published": "2026-05-17T16:33:27", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
